      <image:title>The empty bag </image:title>
      <image:caption>I chose this photograph as the poster for Sacrificed to Feed the World.

That day, I spent hours at Chatt El Salem beach with local fishermen. They kept going out, searching for fish, but they came back with nothing.

When one of them finally walked home, his bag was still empty.

Ahead of him was the chemical industry.

That walk stayed with me. A fisherman returning home with nothing from the sea, with the industry standing in front of him.</image:caption>
