      <image:title>For sale </image:title>
      <image:caption>For years, people lived in this house.

Today, it is for sale.

On its walls, someone has written another message: Stop Pollution.

The two messages now stand together — one suggesting someone is leaving, the other asking why.

The house stands only a short distance from the GCT chemical complex.

Sometimes, a wall tells a story without saying much.</image:caption>
