      <image:title>The work continues</image:title>
      <image:caption>My work has taken me beyond photography. I have appeared in documentaries, films, television and radio programs discussing the environmental reality of Gabès. I also co-created my own documentary, Sacrificed to Feed the World, which has so far been screened in seven countries.

I speak Arabic, English and German, and I use every medium I can to carry these stories further. This website is another part of that work: a place where I can tell these stories through my photographs, in my own words, and at my own pace.

The story of Gabès is still being written. I am here to document it.</image:caption>
